ter of Ghost Pirates of Vooju Island<br></li><li>Atmospheric Beat and Jazz soundtrack by Pedro Macedo Camacho (Fairytale Fights, Ghost Pirates of Vooju Island, A Vampyre Story, Audiosurf)<br></li><li>In-game decisions extensively influence the plot and lead to various endings</li></ul>",
